      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Local Law No. 35 for the year 2014, which amends subchapter 1 of chapter 1 of title 3 of the Administrative Code of the City of New York by adding a new section 3-115, in relation to the creation of a New York city identity card program, was enacted on July 10, 2014;",
